{"id":"n16210-1-7","stage":5,"title":"각기 · 各自","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16210-1-7-1","ko":"어떤 집으로 할지 결정하셨습니까?","zh":"您决定好要选哪套房子了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"집으로","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집으로","audio":"/audio/8a97350e9fb8cc1c83d4.mp3"}},{"text":"할지","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할지","audio":"/audio/156fd116c75acec033e4.mp3"}},{"text":"결정하셨습니까?","meaning":"决定","explanation":"결정하다：决定；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"결정하다","audio":"/audio/683a7ec178e4344d464f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54908","senseId":"1","lemma":"결정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결정하셨습니까","audio":"/audio/8fffd48899394e231aeb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition"